WEBVTT

00:00:00.990 --> 00:00:04.790
Inazuma Eleven GO is about to start!

00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:08.520
Shindou passes to Matsukaze!

00:00:08.790 --> 00:00:10.990
This is the decisive last pass!

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:13.380
I won't let you shoot!

00:00:19.940 --> 00:00:22.560
Oh no, Matsukaze misses!

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:26.040
Raimon has let an opportune chance pass by them!

00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:33.780
Matsukaze.

00:00:35.380 --> 00:00:36.570
Why did you hold back?

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:44.170
You're the only one in Raimon who's not giving his all right now.

00:00:44.170 --> 00:00:45.480
But...

00:00:45.930 --> 00:00:48.480
If you don't feel like playing, then leave the field.

00:02:30.950 --> 00:02:33.570
Raimon is strong, like they say.

00:02:33.570 --> 00:02:37.550
They broke through my Iron Wall Gigadon twice!

00:02:37.550 --> 00:02:41.760
Just shows that you can't be safe with a two-point difference when it comes to Raimon.

00:02:42.880 --> 00:02:46.470
But our team's atmosphere is great right now.

00:02:47.390 --> 00:02:49.370
Let's keep attacking in the second half.

00:02:49.370 --> 00:02:52.670
If we keep going with our soccer, we'll be sure to win against Raimon!

00:02:53.130 --> 00:02:54.030
Yeah!

00:02:58.160 --> 00:03:00.890
Good job catching up in the first half.

00:03:01.700 --> 00:03:06.110
We'll attack head-on in the second half to bring the flow over to our side.

00:03:06.110 --> 00:03:06.660
Yes, sir!

00:03:10.090 --> 00:03:11.140
Kurama.

00:03:12.040 --> 00:03:13.830
You're switching with Kageyama.

00:03:15.560 --> 00:03:20.130
Desert Stadium's quicksand exhausts your energy more than you'd think.

00:03:20.130 --> 00:03:23.050
But the same applies for Arakumo Academy.

00:03:23.050 --> 00:03:27.970
We'll bring in Kageyama who sat out for the first half to break through the defense line in one go.

00:03:28.700 --> 00:03:30.480
Understood, Coach.

00:03:30.950 --> 00:03:32.270
Senpai.

00:03:32.270 --> 00:03:34.980
It's an important match. It's yours for the second half.

00:03:35.650 --> 00:03:38.110
Send 'em into chaos with your speed.

00:03:39.930 --> 00:03:41.070
Leave it to me!

00:03:41.610 --> 00:03:44.240
All right, let's do our best in the second half!

00:03:44.240 --> 00:03:45.020
Yeah!

00:03:46.770 --> 00:03:50.080
I'm not playing with my all?

00:03:50.780 --> 00:03:52.170
That's...

00:03:52.590 --> 00:03:54.330
That's not true!

00:03:58.000 --> 00:04:02.180
The Holy Road semi-finals! Raimon Jr. High versus Arakumo Academy!

00:04:02.180 --> 00:04:04.400
The second half is about to start!

00:04:04.400 --> 00:04:07.220
Desert Stadium tests the endurance of the players.

00:04:07.220 --> 00:04:10.440
Raimon has switched out Kurama with Kageyama,

00:04:10.440 --> 00:04:14.650
while Arakumo Academy starts the second half with no change in their lineup!

00:04:14.650 --> 00:04:17.690
Which team will the goddess of victory shine upon?

00:04:19.070 --> 00:04:22.110
The second half kicks off with Arakumo Academy!

00:04:22.750 --> 00:04:25.240
Tsurugi quickly steals the ball!

00:04:27.460 --> 00:04:28.460
Kageyama!

00:04:28.800 --> 00:04:31.880
Kageyama takes the ball and heads into Arakumo's side!

00:04:32.060 --> 00:04:33.410
Here I come!

00:04:33.820 --> 00:04:34.410
Why, you...!

00:04:35.010 --> 00:04:36.150
He's through!

00:04:36.150 --> 00:04:40.440
Kageyama has just switched in and passed Mazumi and Kida!

00:04:40.770 --> 00:04:41.180
What?!

00:04:41.690 --> 00:04:43.600
Kageyama-kun, looking good!

00:04:43.600 --> 00:04:45.430
All right, keep it up just like that!

00:04:47.450 --> 00:04:48.420
Tsurugi-kun!

00:04:50.450 --> 00:04:55.440
Amemiya Taiyou has come all the way back and splendidly intercepted the ball!

00:04:56.270 --> 00:04:57.210
Taiyou...

00:04:58.250 --> 00:04:59.940
All right, here I come!

00:05:00.520 --> 00:05:01.260
Furuto!

00:05:02.740 --> 00:05:04.140
Arakumo has the ball!

00:05:04.140 --> 00:05:05.630
They're on the attack!

00:05:06.870 --> 00:05:08.030
You won't get through!

00:05:13.530 --> 00:05:16.790
Amemiya makes light of Nishiki and passes to Nebuchi!

00:05:17.290 --> 00:05:17.790
What?

00:05:19.020 --> 00:05:22.980
With Amemiya at the center, everyone in Arakumo Academy attacks!

00:05:23.260 --> 00:05:24.670
Stop them, Tenma!

00:05:24.670 --> 00:05:25.510
O-Okay!

00:05:26.760 --> 00:05:27.980
You won't get through!

00:05:28.600 --> 00:05:29.310
Taiyou!

00:05:34.310 --> 00:05:36.910
Amemiya is on Matsukaze's mark!

00:05:38.260 --> 00:05:39.120
Taiyou.

00:05:39.990 --> 00:05:40.860
Tenma.

00:05:44.370 --> 00:05:46.780
That kind of attack won't work, Tenma.

00:05:48.130 --> 00:05:49.280
What?

00:05:51.430 --> 00:05:53.950
This shouldn't be everything you've got.

00:05:54.970 --> 00:05:59.550
Matsukaze tries to steal the ball, but Amemiya doesn't let him touch it!

00:05:59.550 --> 00:06:01.960
What a show of technique!

00:06:05.310 --> 00:06:10.040
Whether you play against me seriously or not, I'll fight you with everything I've got.

00:06:10.420 --> 00:06:11.680
And I'll win.

00:06:13.480 --> 00:06:17.230
Don't you care about what happens to you?

00:06:17.720 --> 00:06:21.840
I don't know if I'll be able to play again in the next match.

00:06:21.840 --> 00:06:25.860
So I'll play each match as if it's my last!

00:06:28.360 --> 00:06:30.600
That's Amemiya Taiyou's soccer!

00:06:31.490 --> 00:06:34.740
Serious soccer, played with all your might...

00:06:34.740 --> 00:06:38.160
That's <i>Raimon's</i>  soccer!

00:06:38.160 --> 00:06:39.980
That's right, Tenma!

00:06:42.480 --> 00:06:45.750
That's why I had to play against <i>you</i>  guys!

00:06:49.920 --> 00:06:51.470
With you guys...

00:06:51.470 --> 00:06:55.560
With you, I'll be able to enjoy real soccer.

00:06:56.030 --> 00:06:57.080
He's through!

00:06:57.080 --> 00:06:59.520
Amemiya passes Matsukaze in one go!

00:07:03.220 --> 00:07:04.710
Stop him, Kariya!

00:07:04.710 --> 00:07:05.770
I know!

00:07:09.200 --> 00:07:10.460
You won't get through us!

00:07:10.460 --> 00:07:10.900
Yeah!

00:07:14.390 --> 00:07:16.000
A-Amazing!

00:07:16.000 --> 00:07:19.160
Amemiya Taiyou continues to pass through another four!

00:07:19.160 --> 00:07:21.170
He's heading for the goal!

00:07:21.170 --> 00:07:22.080
You won't get there!

00:07:23.890 --> 00:07:24.750
Tenma!

00:07:25.330 --> 00:07:29.260
Taiyou, why is a player like you obeying Fifth Sector?

00:07:29.820 --> 00:07:32.140
Oh, you don't know.

00:07:33.660 --> 00:07:38.230
Fifth Sector's... No, the Holy Emperor's real motive.

00:07:43.860 --> 00:07:47.940
But this has nothing to do with Fifth Sector or the Holy Emperor.

00:07:48.670 --> 00:07:51.380
I'll fight with everything and win!

00:07:51.770 --> 00:07:52.730
That's all!

00:07:53.730 --> 00:07:56.370
Amemiya passes Matsukaze!

00:07:56.710 --> 00:07:59.370
This makes him one-on-one with the goalkeeper Nishizono!

00:07:59.740 --> 00:08:01.370
I'll block it no matter what!

00:08:08.260 --> 00:08:10.420
Planet Guardian God Titanius!

00:08:12.680 --> 00:08:13.930
There!

00:08:15.470 --> 00:08:17.140
Majin The...

00:08:20.050 --> 00:08:24.220
Amemiya puts an intense amount of spin into his shoot!

00:08:27.790 --> 00:08:29.090
It's in!

00:08:29.090 --> 00:08:33.280
Amemiya breaks his way into Raimon's goal with his superior technique!

00:08:36.960 --> 00:08:38.180
3-2!

00:08:38.180 --> 00:08:41.810
Arakumo Academy has taken the lead over Raimon once again!

00:08:43.540 --> 00:08:45.600
I'll be waiting, Tenma.

00:08:47.050 --> 00:08:50.370
I should be able to fly even higher with you around.

00:08:52.000 --> 00:08:53.410
He's strong.

00:08:53.410 --> 00:08:55.000
He's so strong!

00:08:55.600 --> 00:08:57.550
No, he's not just strong.

00:08:58.410 --> 00:09:01.680
He's enjoying soccer more than anything else.

00:09:03.280 --> 00:09:06.360
This is... Taiyou's soccer...

00:09:09.640 --> 00:09:10.750
I see.

00:09:11.210 --> 00:09:13.440
That's what it was, Taiyou.

00:09:14.540 --> 00:09:17.350
I think I finally get it.

00:09:18.490 --> 00:09:20.590
Raimon has the ball for the kickoff.

00:09:20.590 --> 00:09:22.290
Will they be able to counter?

00:09:26.650 --> 00:09:28.120
Kageyama, over here!

00:09:30.960 --> 00:09:35.560
With Amemiya Taiyou at the center, their formation has no openings.

00:09:36.210 --> 00:09:38.510
How do we break past it?

00:09:38.510 --> 00:09:40.780
Captain, give me the ball!

00:09:41.320 --> 00:09:41.970
Tenma!

00:09:42.370 --> 00:09:45.550
I'll fly over the sun!

00:09:47.180 --> 00:09:50.250
Inazuma Eleven GO!

00:09:52.520 --> 00:09:54.280
Inazuma Eleven...

00:09:54.280 --> 00:09:55.530
GO!

00:09:58.060 --> 00:10:00.280
Fly over the sun?

00:10:00.900 --> 00:10:03.790
Matsukaze heads into Arakumo's side!

00:10:04.170 --> 00:10:05.500
He's going to attack by himself?

00:10:05.830 --> 00:10:07.370
That's just crazy!

00:10:07.990 --> 00:10:10.920
But Tenma's eyes, they're...

00:10:12.810 --> 00:10:13.700
All right.

00:10:13.700 --> 00:10:14.620
Tenma!

00:10:14.620 --> 00:10:15.460
It's yours!

00:10:20.490 --> 00:10:22.680
Shindou's pass lands right into Matsukaze's possession!

00:10:22.680 --> 00:10:24.500
A marvelous long pass!

00:10:24.890 --> 00:10:25.270
Yes!

00:10:25.950 --> 00:10:28.060
Shin-sama's pass is so pretty!

00:10:28.060 --> 00:10:29.020
Now, Tenma!

00:10:29.960 --> 00:10:30.880
Stop him!

00:10:30.880 --> 00:10:31.400
Yeah!

00:10:32.580 --> 00:10:34.860
Taiyou, I understand now.

00:10:35.690 --> 00:10:41.370
You got that strong because you've followed through with your feelings.

00:10:42.370 --> 00:10:47.410
Yet I spent all that time worrying over you and not putting my feelings into my plays.

00:10:48.290 --> 00:10:52.280
That would just disappoint both Taiyou and soccer!

00:10:52.280 --> 00:10:53.940
Soyokaze Step!

00:10:58.850 --> 00:11:02.330
I'll pull through with my soccer too!

00:11:02.330 --> 00:11:03.460
Just like Taiyou!

00:11:03.800 --> 00:11:05.010
He's through!

00:11:05.010 --> 00:11:08.740
Matsukaze breaks through the defense line with his impressive dribbling!

00:11:09.300 --> 00:11:09.830
He's coming.

00:11:10.380 --> 00:11:11.850
I won't let you through, Tenma!

00:11:12.510 --> 00:11:15.110
But Amemiya stands in his way!

00:11:23.760 --> 00:11:25.830
Sun God Apollo!

00:11:26.860 --> 00:11:29.370
Amemiya releases his Avatar!

00:11:29.370 --> 00:11:31.610
What will Matsukaze do?

00:11:31.880 --> 00:11:34.450
I'll fly over the sun.

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:38.090
I'll fly higher, and higher!

00:11:38.780 --> 00:11:40.670
With my soccer!

00:11:44.340 --> 00:11:46.240
Reach the heavens!

00:11:47.260 --> 00:11:48.680
This is...

00:11:49.690 --> 00:11:52.060
Demon God Pegasus Arc!

00:11:59.020 --> 00:12:00.110
Tenma...

00:12:03.800 --> 00:12:07.070
Iron Wall Gigadon!

00:12:07.720 --> 00:12:09.380
Gigantic Bomb!

00:12:13.570 --> 00:12:15.000
It's in!

00:12:15.000 --> 00:12:19.050
Matsukaze's shoot plunges into Arakumo's goal!

00:12:19.740 --> 00:12:20.770
They're tied!

00:12:20.770 --> 00:12:24.050
Raimon has tied once again!

00:12:24.540 --> 00:12:26.600
Tenma flew!

00:12:26.600 --> 00:12:27.980
Awesome!

00:12:27.980 --> 00:12:30.060
Demon God Pegasus Arc!

00:12:30.640 --> 00:12:31.810
Tenma-kun!

00:12:31.810 --> 00:12:33.280
You did it!

00:12:33.280 --> 00:12:34.230
Awesome!

00:12:34.230 --> 00:12:36.050
That was awesome, Tenma-kun!

00:12:40.050 --> 00:12:41.890
That's the Tenma I know.

00:12:41.890 --> 00:12:43.810
Are you okay, Taiyou?

00:12:43.810 --> 00:12:44.630
Yeah.

00:12:45.660 --> 00:12:47.550
Demon God Pegasus Arc, huh?

00:12:48.280 --> 00:12:50.950
We'll see if it's stronger than Sun God Apollo.

00:12:51.660 --> 00:12:55.280
But Taiyou, if you use your Avatar anymore, you'll...

00:12:55.280 --> 00:12:57.950
We won't be able to win if I don't use my Avatar.

00:12:59.390 --> 00:13:02.020
So I'd like to borrow everyone's strength.

00:13:02.970 --> 00:13:05.730
Are you going to do <i>that?</i>

00:13:06.160 --> 00:13:07.080
Yeah.

00:13:07.080 --> 00:13:10.820
But that puts even <i>more</i>  stress on your body!

00:13:11.460 --> 00:13:13.350
Let's do it, guys.

00:13:13.350 --> 00:13:13.950
Sata...

00:13:14.710 --> 00:13:18.130
Our team revolves around Amemiya Taiyou.

00:13:18.790 --> 00:13:21.610
We've made it this far thanks to him.

00:13:22.330 --> 00:13:24.900
So this time, we'll support <i>him!</i>

00:13:25.770 --> 00:13:27.180
Guys...

00:13:27.180 --> 00:13:29.370
Well, that's for sure.

00:13:29.670 --> 00:13:33.600
All right, give Taiyou all of our power!

00:13:33.600 --> 00:13:34.560
For our victory!

00:13:34.940 --> 00:13:36.060
Yeah!

00:13:37.350 --> 00:13:41.890
The semi-finals for Holy Road has been a grand display of goal scoring.

00:13:41.890 --> 00:13:46.820
Coach Karibe has brought Amemiya's position down from the top.

00:13:46.820 --> 00:13:50.160
Chihara has entered to replace the forward Hinano.

00:13:50.560 --> 00:13:54.500
Are they aiming to solidify their defense by bringing Amemiya back?

00:13:55.100 --> 00:13:57.480
The score is tied at 3-3.

00:13:57.480 --> 00:13:59.980
Only a short amount of time remains!

00:14:00.880 --> 00:14:02.880
They brought Amemiya back.

00:14:03.340 --> 00:14:07.430
Maybe Taiyou has reached his limit.

00:14:08.320 --> 00:14:13.330
Who will come out victorious from this seesaw game? Raimon or Arakumo?

00:14:15.580 --> 00:14:17.060
Let's go, guys!

00:14:17.060 --> 00:14:17.550
Captain!

00:14:17.970 --> 00:14:20.750
We'll steal the ball and make the final point both at once!

00:14:21.630 --> 00:14:24.590
Shindou dives in to steal the ball!

00:14:25.750 --> 00:14:27.630
He continues to attack!

00:14:29.510 --> 00:14:31.680
Shindou heads towards Amemiya!

00:14:38.240 --> 00:14:38.850
Shindou!

00:14:41.540 --> 00:14:42.360
I'm fine.

00:14:48.790 --> 00:14:50.060
Taiyou...

00:14:50.060 --> 00:14:51.950
He can still use his Avatar?

00:14:51.950 --> 00:14:54.030
Matsukaze, look closely.

00:14:58.370 --> 00:15:00.370
Give Taiyou our power!

00:15:00.720 --> 00:15:01.750
To Taiyou!

00:15:03.320 --> 00:15:03.810
Tenma.

00:15:04.650 --> 00:15:10.170
This is the ability to bring out the Avatar with your teammates' power, Avatar Drawing.

00:15:10.420 --> 00:15:12.890
Avatar... Drawing...

00:15:18.980 --> 00:15:20.420
This is my...

00:15:20.420 --> 00:15:22.500
No, <i>our</i>  Avatar!

00:15:23.100 --> 00:15:25.140
Sun God Apollo!

00:15:27.420 --> 00:15:29.070
Taiyou's made a comeback.

00:15:29.990 --> 00:15:32.560
Turning your teammates' feelings into power...

00:15:33.540 --> 00:15:36.350
Releasing your Avatar with your last power...

00:15:36.780 --> 00:15:38.160
Amazing.

00:15:38.160 --> 00:15:41.030
You fly so high, Taiyou.

00:15:41.550 --> 00:15:43.790
But I won't lose!

00:15:44.240 --> 00:15:47.700
Our soccer will never lose!

00:15:49.200 --> 00:15:51.380
Let's combine our power too.

00:15:51.880 --> 00:15:52.970
The power of our Avatars.

00:15:53.880 --> 00:15:57.930
If we combine our power, we should be able to fly higher than anyone!

00:15:58.620 --> 00:16:01.400
If they've lined themeselves together like batteries,

00:16:01.400 --> 00:16:04.440
then we'll raise our power through a series of circuits.{.w.}

00:16:04.650 --> 00:16:06.080
Is that what you mean, Tenma?

00:16:07.490 --> 00:16:08.060
Let's get to it.

00:16:08.800 --> 00:16:09.570
Here we go!

00:16:09.570 --> 00:16:11.240
Instrumentalist Maestro!

00:16:11.930 --> 00:16:14.030
Sword Saint Lancelot!

00:16:14.310 --> 00:16:16.990
Demon God Pegasus Arc!

00:16:24.030 --> 00:16:25.460
This'll finish it!

00:16:25.960 --> 00:16:28.210
Sunshine Force!

00:16:36.890 --> 00:16:39.570
Amemiya's resurrected Avatar makes a shoot!

00:16:40.060 --> 00:16:41.630
Go!

00:16:47.480 --> 00:16:49.230
Demon Emperor Gryphon!

00:16:57.070 --> 00:16:57.740
That's...

00:17:01.730 --> 00:17:03.730
Demon Emperor Gryphon, huh.

00:17:04.570 --> 00:17:06.110
W-What's this?!

00:17:06.110 --> 00:17:11.430
The three Avatars unified to give birth to a new Avatar!

00:17:12.900 --> 00:17:14.020
Break through them, Taiyou!

00:17:14.440 --> 00:17:15.100
Yeah!

00:17:24.340 --> 00:17:26.690
Shindou, don't give in!

00:17:28.000 --> 00:17:30.120
Stand firm, Tsurugi-kun!

00:17:31.050 --> 00:17:32.690
You can do it, Tenma!

00:17:33.720 --> 00:17:34.190
Yeah!

00:17:38.740 --> 00:17:41.740
GO!!

00:17:44.980 --> 00:17:45.570
I'll block it!

00:17:47.280 --> 00:17:49.040
Gigantic...

00:17:52.380 --> 00:17:54.670
G-Goal!

00:17:54.670 --> 00:17:57.510
Amemiya's Avatar shoot!

00:17:57.510 --> 00:18:02.830
The unified Avatars from Shindou, Tsurugi and Matsukaze shot it back to make a goal!

00:18:02.830 --> 00:18:06.250
It's a turn-around! Raimon makes a comeback!

00:18:07.920 --> 00:18:09.090
We did it.

00:18:09.090 --> 00:18:10.350
Yeah.

00:18:10.350 --> 00:18:11.870
We did it!

00:18:12.740 --> 00:18:14.800
A unison of Avatars, huh...

00:18:14.800 --> 00:18:16.260
They really are something.

00:18:16.260 --> 00:18:18.260
Amazing, it's amazing!

00:18:18.530 --> 00:18:21.180
They're truly incredible!

00:18:23.970 --> 00:18:26.410
There's the end-match whistle!

00:18:26.410 --> 00:18:30.880
The ones to come out victorious from the heroic match is Raimon Jr. High!

00:18:30.880 --> 00:18:34.030
Raimon proceeds to the finals!

00:18:34.920 --> 00:18:36.940
You all did it!

00:18:36.940 --> 00:18:38.230
Yes!

00:18:41.850 --> 00:18:43.930
We...

00:18:43.930 --> 00:18:45.110
...lost...

00:18:49.730 --> 00:18:50.880
T-Taiyou!

00:18:52.640 --> 00:18:54.510
Taiyou, are you okay?

00:19:00.810 --> 00:19:02.750
I used up everything.

00:19:04.300 --> 00:19:06.090
I can't move anymore.

00:19:06.280 --> 00:19:07.390
Taiyou?

00:19:08.560 --> 00:19:13.640
I never knew a match could feel this good.

00:19:16.830 --> 00:19:21.700
This is what you wanted to teach me, wasn't it?

00:19:23.210 --> 00:19:24.820
Thank you.

00:19:26.130 --> 00:19:29.410
Really, thanks, guys.

00:19:30.270 --> 00:19:31.240
Taiyou.

00:19:32.280 --> 00:19:34.300
That was one intense fight.

00:19:34.760 --> 00:19:35.440
Yeah.

00:19:36.900 --> 00:19:39.340
That was the best match ever, Tenma.

00:19:40.690 --> 00:19:44.170
I'm really glad I got to fight you guys.

00:19:44.960 --> 00:19:47.880
I have nothing more to regret now.

00:19:48.510 --> 00:19:49.370
Taiyou...

00:19:51.050 --> 00:19:53.420
I have nothing more to regret, and yet...

00:19:54.130 --> 00:19:56.190
Tenma, what should I do?

00:19:56.190 --> 00:19:58.960
I still want to play soccer...

00:20:00.980 --> 00:20:02.610
I want to play soccer!

00:20:04.570 --> 00:20:05.850
Taiyou...

00:20:07.900 --> 00:20:09.090
You'll definitely be able to!

00:20:10.610 --> 00:20:13.520
You fought so hard with all your might!

00:20:16.290 --> 00:20:19.940
I'm sure your health will get better so you can go back to the field!

00:20:20.700 --> 00:20:25.050
As long as you give it all you've got, you'll be able to overcome any obstacle.

00:20:25.050 --> 00:20:28.160
<i>You're</i>  the one who taught me that!

00:20:29.080 --> 00:20:29.700
Tenma!

00:20:30.410 --> 00:20:33.210
When that day comes, let's play soccer again, okay?

00:20:33.920 --> 00:20:37.760
I'll wait for as long as it takes for you to come back!

00:20:39.040 --> 00:20:41.210
All right, Tenma.

00:20:41.880 --> 00:20:44.010
I won't give in to this sickness.

00:20:44.010 --> 00:20:47.770
I'll keep practicing and be sure to come back!

00:20:49.990 --> 00:20:51.830
It's a promise, Taiyou.

00:20:51.830 --> 00:20:52.620
Yeah.

00:20:53.650 --> 00:20:59.530
The stadium proudly applauds the two teams after the fierce fight!

00:21:00.170 --> 00:21:05.810
It was a magnificent match, 
Arakumo Academy Eleven and Raimon Eleven!

00:21:06.900 --> 00:21:09.210
The finals is next at last.

00:21:09.470 --> 00:21:10.510
Yeah.

00:21:10.510 --> 00:21:14.790
We'll be sure to bring back real soccer with the championship.

00:21:16.450 --> 00:21:17.210
Shindou?

00:21:23.890 --> 00:21:24.930
Captain?

00:22:53.780 --> 00:22:55.850
Coach Endou finally returns!

00:22:56.030 --> 00:23:00.330
During this crisis from Captain Shindou's absence, what will Coach's next decision be?

00:23:00.330 --> 00:23:04.860
Next on Inazuma Eleven GO, 
 New Captain! Matsukaze Tenma!!

00:23:04.860 --> 00:23:06.530
This is super-dimensional soccer!

00:23:15.100 --> 00:23:17.870
The Inazuma Eleven GO's proverb today is...

00:23:22.410 --> 00:23:26.740
As long as you give it all you've got, you'll be able to overcome any obstacle!

00:23:26.740 --> 00:23:27.450
That's all!
